# Muze Plan / Backlog

Use `next-steps.todo` for the short launch queue. This file keeps product decisions, later ideas, and things we explicitly do not want to implement right now.

## Later Product Decisions / Not In Current Next Steps

☐ decide if we want to show top 10s on profile or not and how we are gonna do it
    Current leaning: do not implement before launch. Evaluate compact taste preview vs exact Top 10 items.

☐ find out a way to make a filled up account feel stronger and make users feel growth over time
    Current launch version: private own-profile growth hint is done. Do not add public scores/leaderboards/status.

☐ after fill up any top 10 if there is a relative discussion bot should send a invitation to the user
    Not for launch. Needs frequency cap, active-room handling, join-rule safety, and no invitation Star reward.

☐ add inline mode chat to save item to lists
    Not for launch. Decide supported sections, Top 10 vs watchlist/list only, and duplicate behavior first.

☐ later: add another label if all items in a Top 10 relate to one person, band, or creator and call it "X fan"
    Not for launch. Define exact criteria first, avoid false claims, and keep it fun rather than ranking/status.

